 435 000633* 3202          DCA     GIVTRIM                 /ALIGNED EXIT
 436 000634* 1314          TAD     GCOMSW                  /GET COMMENT SWITCH
 437 000635* 7650          SNA CLA                         /SKIP IF SET
 438 000636* 5241          JMP     GIVNORMAL               /JUMP IF NOT
